1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,459
Hi kids, I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:02,759 --> 00:00:08,019
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets the Little Prince~

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:15,740
Last time, the little prince and the fox became good friends.

4
00:00:16,039 --> 00:00:24,259
The fox said taming means building ties, and it takes heart to be friends.

5
00:00:24,559 --> 00:00:31,500
Today, the little prince has something very hard to tell Qiqi...

6
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:36,660
He's going back to his star.

7
00:00:36,960 --> 00:00:39,340
The desert was very quiet at night.

8
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:43,380
The little prince sat on a sand dune, looking at the sky.

9
00:00:43,679 --> 00:00:47,899
Little prince, what are you looking at?

10
00:00:48,199 --> 00:00:49,619
I'm looking at my star.

11
00:00:49,919 --> 00:00:52,079
Qiqi, I have to go back.

12
00:00:52,379 --> 00:00:54,999
Go back? Go where?

13
00:00:55,299 --> 00:00:58,559
To where I came from—that tiny little star.

14
00:00:58,859 --> 00:01:04,599
But... didn't you just make friends with the fox?

15
00:01:04,899 --> 00:01:06,319
I'll miss you all so much.

16
00:01:06,619 --> 00:01:08,359
But my rose is waiting for me.

17
00:01:08,659 --> 00:01:11,919
She only has four thorns. Anyone could hurt her.

18
00:01:12,219 --> 00:01:13,879
I can hear her calling me...

19
00:01:14,179 --> 00:01:16,799
Will you come back?

20
00:01:17,099 --> 00:01:18,219
Qiqi, look up.

21
00:01:18,519 --> 00:01:21,219
The little prince pointed at the sky.

22
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:23,739
There are so many stars up there, right?

23
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:25,619
One of them is my home.

24
00:01:25,919 --> 00:01:28,539
When you miss me, just look up at the stars.

25
00:01:28,839 --> 00:01:31,139
I'll be on that star, smiling at you.

26
00:01:31,439 --> 00:01:36,779
Then I'll look at the stars every night!

27
00:01:37,079 --> 00:01:39,699
Qiqi's eyes were a little red.

28
00:01:39,999 --> 00:01:42,859
The little prince gave her a gentle hug.

29
00:01:43,159 --> 00:01:45,219
Qiqi hugged him back tightly.

30
00:01:45,519 --> 00:01:46,459
Don't be sad.

31
00:01:46,759 --> 00:01:49,459
People who have tamed each other never truly part.

32
00:01:49,759 --> 00:01:52,539
As long as you remember me, I'm right here.

33
00:01:52,839 --> 00:01:56,179
I'll always remember!

34
00:01:56,479 --> 00:02:00,779
Kids, what do you do when you miss someone?

35
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:04,419
Do you look up at the sky too?

36
00:02:04,719 --> 00:02:12,379
Next time, Qiqi will draw a rose for the farthest star.

37
00:02:12,679 --> 00:02:15,779
Good night, see you tomorrow~ ⭐

